        "source_symbol": "ordered_weighted_sum",
        "description": "Multiply rows by coefficients, then add in row order using float64. Require a nonempty two-dimensional real numeric array and one finite real coefficient per row. Convert both inputs to float64 before arithmetic. Start with the first product, then add each remaining product left to right; do not use a dot product, pairwise reduction, or normalization. Negative, zero and non-unit-sum coefficients are valid. Reject overflow in any product or partial sum. Return a fresh vector without changing either input. Rows, columns, coefficients, units and interpretation are caller policy.",
